error[T-Bound]: `F` requires `Owned`, and `<closure>` can carry a borrow: `label` is a `borrow String[mem.SystemAllocator]`, an observation of another value
  --> tests/defer_let/a_call_refused_for_its_callback_is_its_only_report.lin:35:25
   |
35 |     defer var results = lazy_map([read label] |sink k| k * label.view().length())
   |                         ^^^^^^^^ `<closure>` is not `Owned`; pass a value whose type owns everything it holds, or drop the bound
